{"2531910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cards of Destiny", "steam_appid": 2531910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "Cards of Destiny is a VR puzzle game that brings a frantic tabletop experience to a unique, immersive environment! <br><br>PLAY AS A GOD<br>Turn into a godlike being as you draw one-time-use cards that can BLESS or CURSE the critters on the tabletop – humans and aliens alike!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/bd856ecb2c4cccaf0e3787545e251b35.poster.avif?t=1777390672\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/bd856ecb2c4cccaf0e3787545e251b35.webm?t=1777390672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/bd856ecb2c4cccaf0e3787545e251b35.mp4?t=1777390672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/8de6ed097e9fd43c4135c3e1ecf70f91.poster.avif?t=1777390672\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/8de6ed097e9fd43c4135c3e1ecf70f91.webm?t=1777390672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/8de6ed097e9fd43c4135c3e1ecf70f91.mp4?t=1777390672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>SEAL THE FATE OF HUMANITY<br>You need to save the tiny humans from the evil aliens!… Or do you? Like any child playing with toys, sometimes you favor the baddies because it’s fun. Many levels will require you to let some humans die – pay close attention and don’t get attached.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/e4c896613c19f18a48ba80f2d4737b43.poster.avif?t=1777390672\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/e4c896613c19f18a48ba80f2d4737b43.webm?t=1777390672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/e4c896613c19f18a48ba80f2d4737b43.mp4?t=1777390672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>MAGIC CARDS<br>Every card has a unique effect which can only be used once: turn your hand into a hammer, put out fires with an ice spray, or even spawn in some aliens! But do it quick and get another card right away, or you’ll run out of options!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/3ba74f11525610dbcb44b3de481b70e4.poster.avif?t=1777390672\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/3ba74f11525610dbcb44b3de481b70e4.webm?t=1777390672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/3ba74f11525610dbcb44b3de481b70e4.mp4?t=1777390672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/aab77037670c131c63627ca719ac766f.poster.avif?t=1777390672\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/aab77037670c131c63627ca719ac766f.webm?t=1777390672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/aab77037670c131c63627ca719ac766f.mp4?t=1777390672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>ADAPT TO DIFFERENT CARDS AND SITUATIONS<br>It’s an epic battle with many souls on the line – and you have to play the hand you’re dealt! Think carefully about the layout of each level and exactly which cards to play or you’ll fail.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/7796f6c286039edefe10858badaca5e8.poster.avif?t=1777390672\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/7796f6c286039edefe10858badaca5e8.webm?t=1777390672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/7796f6c286039edefe10858badaca5e8.mp4?t=1777390672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>CO-OP CROSS-PLAY<br>Cards of Destiny supports cross-play multiplayer! With unique puzzles that call for you and your friend to be in total sync, test your co-op skills and play together on Steam, Quest, Pico or PSVR2!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/9b88d901737b6f1eb51af3f68eb89540.poster.avif?t=1777390672\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/9b88d901737b6f1eb51af3f68eb89540.webm?t=1777390672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/9b88d901737b6f1eb51af3f68eb89540.mp4?t=1777390672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "about_the_game": "Cards of Destiny is a VR puzzle game that brings a frantic tabletop experience to a unique, immersive environment! <br><br>PLAY AS A GOD<br>Turn into a godlike being as you draw one-time-use cards that can BLESS or CURSE the critters on the tabletop – humans and aliens alike!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/bd856ecb2c4cccaf0e3787545e251b35.poster.avif?t=1777390672\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/bd856ecb2c4cccaf0e3787545e251b35.webm?t=1777390672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/bd856ecb2c4cccaf0e3787545e251b35.mp4?t=1777390672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/8de6ed097e9fd43c4135c3e1ecf70f91.poster.avif?t=1777390672\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/8de6ed097e9fd43c4135c3e1ecf70f91.webm?t=1777390672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/8de6ed097e9fd43c4135c3e1ecf70f91.mp4?t=1777390672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>SEAL THE FATE OF HUMANITY<br>You need to save the tiny humans from the evil aliens!… Or do you? Like any child playing with toys, sometimes you favor the baddies because it’s fun. Many levels will require you to let some humans die – pay close attention and don’t get attached.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/e4c896613c19f18a48ba80f2d4737b43.poster.avif?t=1777390672\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531910/extras/e4c896613c19f18a48